#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Prepare exact native admission bytes; never launches trials or changes git.

Run `draft` once source/config bytes are final, then validate/freeze protocol,
commit/push the draft and sources, and run `preview`. Preview grants no authority.
`promote` copies only a packet that native preapproval has accepted, and writes
its approval decision; root must then archive, publish and pass ready checks.
"""
